                       UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT\n14\n                                NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA\n15\n                                       SAN JOSE DIVISION\n16\n\n17   GOOGLE LLC                                   Case No. 5:24-cv-05423-EJD\n18                 Plaintiff,                     GOOGLE LLC\u2019S STATEMENT OF\n19                                                RECENT DECISION\n            v.\n20   NAO TSARGRAD MEDIA, ANO TV-\n     NOVOSTI, AND NO FOND\n21   PRAVOSLAVNOGO TELEVIDENIYA,\n22\n                   Defendants.\n23\n\n24\n\n25\n\n26\n\n27\n\n28\n\n\n      STATEMENT OF RECENT DECISION\n\f     Case 5:24-cv-05423-EJD          Document 114      Filed 01/22/25     Page 2 of 2\n\n\n\n\n 1                               STATEMENT OF RECENT DECISION\n\n 2          Plaintiff Google LLC, by and through its undersigned counsel, respectfully submits this\n\n 3   Statement of Recent Decision pursuant to Civil Local Rule 7-3(d)(2) to notify the Court of the\n\n 4   following judgment by the English Court (His Honour Judge Henshaw), in Claim Nos. CL-2024-\n\n 5   000477 (Google LLC v No Fond Pravoslavnogo Televideniya), CL-2024-000478 (Google LLC\n\n 6   & Google Ireland Limited v NAO Tsargrad Media), CL-2024-000479 (Google LLC v ANO TV-\n\n 7   Novosti) and CL-2024-000480 (Google Ireland Limited v ANO TV-Novosti) which was publicly\n\n 8   handed down on January 22, 2025 following applications by Google LLC and Google Ireland\n\n 9   Limited to the King\u2019s Bench Division (Commercial Court) of the English High Court for similar\n\n10   relief to that sought before this Court:\n\n11          Google LLC & another v NAO Tsargrad Media & Others [2025] EWHC 94 (Comm),\n\n12 attached hereto as Exhibit 1.\n\n13 Dated: January 22, 2025                       KING & SPALDING LLP\n14                                               By: /s/ Olivia A. Radin\n                                                       OLIVIA A. RADIN\n15                 